BACKUP ~Orelios/Backup~
//AUTHOR ~Danzig!~
SUPPORT ~PaulaMigrate@mail.com~
VERSION ~2.0~

ALWAYS
ACTION_IF GAME_IS ~eet~ BEGIN
    OUTER_SET bg2_chapter = 12
  END ELSE BEGIN
    OUTER_SET bg2_chapter = 0
  END
 OUTER_FOR (i=1; i<=10; i=i+1) BEGIN
    OUTER_SET bg2_chapter = bg2_chapter + 1
    OUTER_SPRINT name_source ~bg2_chapter_%i%~
    OUTER_SET EVAL ~%name_source%~ = bg2_chapter
  END
END  

BEGIN ~Orelios NPC~

COPY ~Orelios/Misc/PM_Orel.cre~ ~override~
SAY NAME1 ~奥雷利奥斯~
SAY NAME2 ~奥雷利奥斯~
SAY BIO ~被人问及过往时，奥雷利奥斯说自己是阿格拉隆德维塔拉城人氏，该城远在坠星海对岸的东方。他说他是在与你相遇约一年半前来安姆的。他在阿格拉隆德军中度了多年，两个女儿也长大成人之后才离乡，只是他不曾细说她们，也不曾说自己是怎样从军人转为冒险者的。那显然是段很长的旅程，因为他到阿斯卡特拉才几个月。他的气度是深沉的平静，却也有精到的自持。他脸上难得显情，即便显也极轻，你们同行至今他从未抬高过嗓门。行路时他总在扫视周遭，仿佛在心里编着一册莫测的目录。~
SAY MORALE ~我只能做这么多了。我逃。~
SAY HAPPY ~我对这队伍所为十分满意。~
SAY UNHAPPY_ANNOYED ~行事之前须先思量。~
SAY UNHAPPY_SERIOUS ~我先提醒你，这样的鲁莽我再也受不了多少。~
SAY UNHAPPY_BREAKING ~我已到了极限。希望你在我走后能想明白些。~
SAY LEADER ~那是我的荣幸。~ [PM_Orelb]
SAY TIRED ~今日再无可得。我们歇息吧。~ [PM_Orelc]
SAY BORED ~既然能把时间用在有利之处，何必空耗？~ [PM_Oreld]
SAY BATTLE_CRY1 ~愿诸神给我力气。~ [PM_Orela]
SAY BATTLE_CRY2 ~为了胜利。~ [PM_Orel8]
SAY BATTLE_CRY3 ~为了胜利。~ [PM_Orel8]
SAY BATTLE_CRY4 ~愿诸神给我力气。~ [PM_Orela]
SAY DAMAGE ~呃！~ [PM_Orell]
SAY DYING ~啊！~ [PM_Orelm]
SAY HURT ~恐怕我受伤了。~ [PM_Orele]
SAY AREA_FOREST ~我几乎想起尤尔林了。林地不合我。~
SAY AREA_CITY ~啊，城市……记得在此凝神，否则你难免被分神。~
SAY AREA_DUNGEON ~保持镇定，留意四周。只要我们有所准备，能伤我们的很少。~
SAY AREA_DAY ~好天气，嗯？日头暖和，叫人受用。~
SAY AREA_NIGHT ~我一向更喜欢夜的安静，即便它有危险。~
SAY SELECT_COMMON1 ~我能帮什么？~ [PM_Orelf]
SAY SELECT_COMMON2 ~我该如何效劳？~ [PM_Orelg]
SAY SELECT_COMMON3 ~是的？~ [PM_Orelh]
SAY SELECT_COMMON4 ~有话直说。~ [PM_Orelx]
SAY SELECT_COMMON5 ~是的？~ [PM_Orelh]
SAY SELECT_COMMON6 ~我能帮什么？~ [PM_Orelf]
SAY SELECT_ACTION1 ~当然。~ [PM_Oreli]
SAY SELECT_ACTION2 ~会办成的。~ [PM_Orelk]
SAY SELECT_ACTION3 ~很好。~ [PM_Orelj]
SAY SELECT_ACTION5 ~同意。~ [PM_Orels]
SAY SELECT_ACTION6 ~立刻。~ [PM_Orelt]
SAY SELECT_ACTION7 ~前行。~ [PM_Orelu]
SAY REACT_TO_DIE_GENERAL ~我会确保你得到体面的安葬。~ [PM_Orelw]
SAY SELECT_RARE1 ~有话就说，说完快走。~ [PM_RARE1]
SAY SELECT_RARE2 ~我盼你那孩子气的心智能早些转向别的消遣。~ [PM_RARE2]
SAY CRITICAL_HIT ~降服吧！~ [PM_Orelz]
SAY CRITICAL_MISS ~该死。~
SAY TARGET_IMMUNE ~我破不了这防御。~
SAY HIDDEN_IN_SHADOWS ~前进。~ [PM_Orel5]
SAY SPELL_DISRUPTED ~我的专注被打断了。~
SAY INVENTORY_FULL ~我的力气到了限，扛不动更多了。~

COMPILE ~Orelios/D/PM_Orel.d~
COMPILE ~Orelios/D/BOrelios.d~
COMPILE ~Orelios/D/PMOrelJ.d~
COMPILE EVALUATE_BUFFER~Orelios/Baf/PM_Orel.baf~

EXTEND_TOP ~AR0406.bcs~ ~Orelios/Baf/AR0406.baf~

LAF HANDLE_AUDIO END

APPEND ~pdialog.2da~
~PMOrel PMOrelP PMOrelJ PMOrelD PMOrelP PMOrelJ PMOrelD PM_Orel~
UNLESS ~PMOrel~

APPEND ~interdia.2da~
~PMOrel BOrelios BOrelios~
UNLESS ~PMOrel~

COPY ~Orelios/portrait~ ~override~

COPY ~Orelios/Misc/PM_Blank.mus~ ~music~
COPY_EXISTING ~songlist.2da~ ~override~
SET_2DA_ENTRY 0 2 3 ~PM_BLANK.MUS~

COPY ~Orelios/spells/PMarmor.spl~ ~override~
SAY NAME1 ~拒伤~

COPY ~Orelios/spells/PMmirro.spl~ ~override~
SAY NAME1 ~拒视~

COPY ~Orelios/spells/PMdecei.spl~ ~override~
SAY NAME1 ~拒诈~

COPY ~Orelios/spells/PMmagic.spl~ ~override~
SAY NAME1 ~拒法~
